  "body": "Tucked away from the main road this amazing home is situated in a highly desirable location for sought after school zones and enjoys stunning sea views. It is also close to local amenities including beaches, shops and public transport. \r\n\r\nThe generous two-story layout boasts ample space with a generous floor area for a growing family or those who love to entertain guests. The Chef of the home will love the new designer open plan kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe second living room downstairs flows out to a private courtyard, the perfect retreat for parents or teenagers who may want to have their own ME time.\r\n\r\nFour generous sized bedrooms including the MEGA-sized master with walk-in wardrobe & ensuite is impressive, along with a separate office perfect for working from home or it could be used as a 5th bedroom.\r\n\r\nEasy-care grounds with no lawns to mow makes this home a winner for enjoying all that a Bays' lifestyle has to offer. Don't miss out on this incredible opportunity to own a stunning property in Mairangi Bay.\r\nBe Quick - Come along to the open homes - This home will be Sold on or before Auction Day!",
